y. Now I have more to add. Thanks for posting these!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1257-kerensky","name":"Kerensky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1257_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T00:21:04-07:00","id":233928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kerensky</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/209743-mood-music?p=219076#post219076\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eagerly awaiting the next set. I've got quite a few of these tracks on heavy rotation in my iTunes library. Now I have more to add. Thanks for posting these!</div> </div> </div> </div>Enjoy! I'm currently at work at it as I speak! It's been interesting finding stuff that's more thematic instead of direct. I'll be glad to hear further input. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000080\">&quot;There is the world of light, and the world of darkness. And some in the light prefer the darkness.&quot; \u2014 Loren Eiseley, <i>The Night Country</i></span>","edited":{"userid":583,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/583-zsander","user":"Zsander","date":". 08-19-2014, 03:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/583-zsander","name":"Zsander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar583_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T15:14:47-07:00","id":243451,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\">I felt inspired by Zsander, so I put a short playlist of music together. This is along the lines of what I listen to when I'm writing for my chronicle.<br /> <br /> No particular order to these tracks.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_tyR86IdbT4&amp;list=PLyUSJsBW7mETBnBRet1DV_HWvRZB_BuDS\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_tyR86IdbT4&amp;list=PLyUSJsBW7mETBnBRet1DV_HW vRZB_BuDS</span></span></span></a><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Covenant - Beat the Noise</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Gary Numan - Haunted</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mesh - How Long (Full Duration Pump Mix)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MGMT - Time to Pretend</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Claire Voyant - Time and the Maiden (Luxt Remix)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Nero - My Eyes</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Snake River Conspiracy - Love Song</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Foo Fighters - February Stars</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The Chain Gang of 1974 - Sleepwalking</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Deftones - Knife Party</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">De/Vision - Star-Crossed Lovers</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Breaking Benjamin - So Cold</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Faith No More - Stripsearch</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Puscifer - The Rapture (Fear is a Mind Killa Mix)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Bruderschaft - Return (Imperative Reaction Remix)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Psyclon Nine - Parasitic</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1257-kerensky","name":"Kerensky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1257_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-12T00:34:37-07:00","id":255100,"title":"","content":"I've finally managed to round out the soundtrack I had in mind. Some of it might seem a bit . . . unusual . . . to some, but I was trying more for theme and atmosphere in some cases. (For example, I wouldn't have imagined Kongos to be something for a chronicle, but the more I listen to it, the more it sounds like something you'd hear blasting out of the stereo inside a truck with a Gangrel or Daeva behind the wheel.) So, here goes:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLzVOT8yDI0Kcfdmxl7NDEgrJYB4xSOcpW\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLzVOT8yDI0Kcfdmxl7NDEgrJYB4xSOcpW\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLzVOT8yDI0Kcfdmxl7NDEgrJYB4xSOcpW\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLzVOT8yDI0Kcfdmxl7NDEgrJYB4xSOcpW </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> 1. Filter - One<br /> 2. Kongos - Come With Me Now<br /> 3. Sisters of Mercy feat. Ofra Haza - Temple of Love<br /> 4. Remy Zero - Gramarye<br /> 5. Bjork - An Echo A Stain<br /> 6. Interpol - Lights<br /> 7. Bush - Mouth (Stingray Mix)<br /> 8. Rob Zombie - Superbeast<br /> 9. Course of Empire - Infested<br /> 10. Bowie - All The Pretty Things Are Going To Hell<br /> 11. VNV Nation - Off Screen<br /> 12. Velvet Underground - Venus in Furs<br /> 13. A Perfect Circle - Passive<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000080\">&quot;There is the world of light, and the world of darkness. And some in the light prefer the darkness.&quot; \u2014 Loren Eiseley, <i>The Night Country</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/583-zsander","name":"Zsander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar583_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-12T17:37:38-07:00","id":255687,"title":"","content":"From Onyx Path's pages on assorted social networks, the visitor suggestions for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/TheOnyxPath/playlists\" target=\"_blank\">Youtube playlists</a> for various games. I, for one, made more Goth suggestions for <b>Masquerade</b> and less for <b>Requiem</b>, but there are some artists and styles that recur in various lists.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craig Oxbrow<br /> <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-12T23:07:47-07:00","id":255867,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fX7WEzJuUiE\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fX7WEzJuUiE\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fX7WEzJuUiE\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fX7WEzJuUiE </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> Krokodil by St. Vincent: Her most punk influenced song. Its about the drug, but could be easily used as a metaphor for hunger Frenzy.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ktwlN_ocL-o\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ktwlN_ocL-o\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ktwlN_ocL-o\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ktwlN_ocL-o </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> Michael by Franz Ferdinand: For that extra sexy scene. Also watch the video and become inspired by what celerity based dancing looks like and some ideas for uses of nightmare.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt1o8uKykUc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt1o8uKykUc\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt1o8uKykUc\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt1o8uKykUc </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> Crimes by The Blood Brothers: Not directly vampiric influenced, but I have used it for a vitae den filled with drugged out ghouls.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iAs0xcSKvqs\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iAs0xcSKvqs\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iAs0xcSKvqs\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iAs0xcSKvqs </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> My Boy Builds Coffins by Florence and the Machine: Used it as a song sang by a Daeva musician during a meeting of Elysium.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmqbhyS-BK8\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmqbhyS-BK8</a><br /> Boss Music for SMT: Nocturne used as good background music for, well, storyline combat.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vVEa70NU_Og\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vVEa70NU_Og</a><br /> Perhaps Vampires is a Bit Strong But\u2026 by The Arctic Monkeys: For obvious reasons.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W0jHnWbbFjI\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W0jHnWbbFjI</a><br /> Drain the Blood by The Distillers: Also obvious<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ABS-mlep5rY\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ABS-mlep5rY</a><br /> Fear and Delight by The Correspondents: The very definition of what it feels like to be a vampire. Also, some of their other songs work as great inspiration (Cheating With You could be inspiration for a neonate filled with power, or the changing dynamics of a relationship with a touchstone)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8UkFDSwDJiQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8UkFDSwDJiQ</a><br /> The Polite Dance Song by The Bird and the Bee: For those situations where someone with no sex appeal uses majesty/seductive beast.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K0YI0UUazkU\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K0YI0UUazkU</a><br /> Die By the Drop by The Dead Weather: For those moments were you need something a little more western.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y7Wot63VSGg\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y7Wot63VSGg</a><br /> Occupy Your Mind by The Villagers: Do you want a song for Dominate? Here is the song.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3707-thediabadass","name":"TheDiabadass","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T00:59:01-07:00","id":255881,"title":"","content":"Here's my current writing music: <br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLYn1WFpRMfTAsdniNF9_5pvBWlraGlvcH\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.youtube.com/playlist?list..._5pvBWlraGlvcH</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T07:41:28-07:00","id":256033,"title":"","content":"I'm actually kind of surprised by all the songs with lyrics here. Maybe it's just my groups that can't handle songs with lyrics (either they start complaining about the song if they recognize it or they start critiquing the lyrics meaning, which can turn into really interesting two hour discussions in and of themselves). <br /> <br /> That being said, I've a number of soundtracks I've made use of over the years: Mass Effects 1-3, Silent Hills 2-4, Broken Notes (A Silent Hill remix album), pretty much any and all of the Castlevanias (I lean heavily on the Castlevanias). I've got a few background songs I pulled from Ghost of the Shell to get an appropriately punkish sounding noise for the Carthian Movement.<br /> <br /> I especially like this one. I use it for the Invictus or the Ordo depending on the game, it's as stodgily gothic as it gets:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PHfe0jhEAyU\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PHfe0jhEAyU</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1097-underwoodfive","name":"underwoodfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T16:08:39-07:00","id":256342,"title":"","content":"Yeah, lyrics can add to distractions - I don't generally actually play music at the session, but I'll reference it as well as playing it while doing session prep work, and sometimes play one piece to set the mood early on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craig Oxbrow<br /> <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-14T08:25:30-07:00","id":256653,"title":"","content":"I'm also surprised of the large presence of songs with lyrics.<br /> <br /> My playlist for neonoir GMC (an adaptation of &quot;The Unwilling Donor&quot; story in Urban Legends) : <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R7tjdHBmGd4&amp;list=PLgxF4RqpgAJJ4Z1oL6E_Vg77YjaMetWO0&amp;index=1\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R7tj...MetWO0&amp;index=1</a><br /> My playlist for a nomad bikers B&amp;S chronicle between Chicago &amp; Mexico : <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CgXukKP1ByU&amp;list=PLgxF4RqpgAJJqfF9okPZd0s7u8553hRvS&amp;index=3\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CgXu...53hRvS&amp;index=3</a><br /> My rome &quot;action Playlist&quot; : <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4un7Jedpicg&amp;index=11&amp;list=PLgxF4RqpgAJKtmWqNj4ZA874F1NhXSR2m\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4un7...ZA874F1NhXSR2m</a> I use the soundtrack for total war 2 the most of the time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/824-araknee","name":"Araknee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar824_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-16T16:31:33-08:00","id":342387,"title":"","content":"Just heard this song on the radio this weekend. Totally infected my headspace since then. I think it's appropriate. I'd say it's probably NSFW.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bR5u9jb0PJE\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bR5u9jb0PJE\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bR5u9jb0PJE\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bR5u9jb0PJE </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1257-kerensky","name":"Kerensky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1257_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-17T07:16:05-08:00","id":342898,"title":"","content":"<br /> How about this?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9NvaTQRgNyc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9NvaTQRgNyc\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9NvaTQRgNyc\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9NvaTQRgNyc </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-17T10:25:41-08:00","id":343078,"title":"","content":"my friends all want to listen to a bunch of hipster bullshit and tracks with danny brown's goofy voice on them<span style=\"font-size:13px\"> but I'm the GM and I say we listen to the kaiji ost on loop </span>\u00af\\_(\u30c4)_/\u00af","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4554-ndisi-the-king","name":"ndisi the king","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-17T12:25:29-08:00","id":343139,"title":"","content":"I use music with lyrics. With one of my old groups, game soundtracks were one of the ways we'd share our music discoveries. The only time I had trouble with that was the time that a player's name was in the song. That left the group in giggle fits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-17T12:50:37-08:00","id":343149,"title":"","content":"Going through my Actual Play notes, here are the most significant songs I used for my first <i>Requiem</i> session:<ul><li>Butterfly Boucher, &quot;Another White Dash&quot; (main theme)</li> <li>Wang Chung, &quot;City of the Angels&quot; (looking for shelter desperately as the sun comes up)</li> <li>Bleak, &quot;In Vain&quot;</li> <li>Lacuna Coil, &quot;Comalies&quot; (meeting the werewolf who rules the streets as an old-time sheriff)</li> <li>Garbage, &quot;Sleep Together&quot; (cruising the waterfront looking for food)</li> <li>New Order, &quot;Confusion&quot; (first fight scene)</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-17T13:17:48-08:00","id":343156,"title":"","content":"I also play music that's being co-opted, because of the themes in play. everybody thinks its just a mixtape though lol. guess us INTJs really are better than other people. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tgf_ekShQFs\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tgf_ekShQFs</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4554-ndisi-the-king","name":"ndisi the king","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-17T22:16:30-08:00","id":343687,"title":"","content":"I prefer songs without lyrics for actual game sessions.<br /> <br /> For most WoD games these two bands are my go-to for music:<br /> <br /> Midnight Syndicate: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z3w2OCylUTU&amp;list=RDHCS7mr7szz1WU\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z3w2O...DHCS7mr7szz1WU</a><br /> <br /> Nox Arcana: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E0LDtwAaJBo&amp;list=RDHCNlgqROTDAls\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E0LDt...DHCNlgqROTDAls</a><br /> <br /> For music with lyrics that I like to use as inspiration, besides the already much mentioned Lacuna Coil, I love the Birthday Massacre. Here's an example of a song I'm 90% sure was actually written about being a Toreador: The Birthday Massacre - Pale: <a href=\"http://youtu.be/dX1OfE5DPAQ\" target=\"_blank\">http://youtu.be/dX1OfE5DPAQ</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://paizo.com/campaigns/RageAcrossIreland/gameplay\" target=\"_blank\">My W20 Play-by-Post Game</a>","edited":{"userid":2760,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2760-formosus","user":"Formosus","date":". 12-18-2014, 04:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2760-formosus","name":"Formosus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-18T11:50:16-08:00","id":344014,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I find I can't do lyrics when trying to set a mood. Video game and movie music all the way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T15:48:38-08:00","id":350995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aiden</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/209743-mood-music?p=344014#post344014\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, I find I can't do lyrics when trying to set a mood. Video game and movie music all the way.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I tend to go the other way. Most people don't listen to instrumentals and good ones are hard to find.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you want By Night Studios to release new LARP RULES for NWoD,<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/313137-open-letter-to-by-night-studios\" target=\"_blank\">like this post</a>.<br /> <br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=62\" data-tempid=\"temp_62_1418088885567_853\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/594-chattnos","name":"Chattnos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"879"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T16:24:12-08:00","id":351033,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dcxsheROd3E\" target=\"_blank\">Building Steam From a Grain Salt</a><br /> Good for a storm building storywise.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-_6BBAVfzqM\" target=\"_blank\">Daeva Mood Music</a><br /> <br /> Killing Strangers by Manson (not out yet)<br /> <br /> <b>&quot;Who You Talkin' To Man&quot;- Lyric Video</b><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yF1e5FxDwQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yF1e5FxDwQ\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yF1e5FxDwQ\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yF1e5FxDwQ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2PSo09V2mak&amp;list=PLhunwf9HYX6NS4mOokw2MSJ7Um_BSaTHi\" target=\"_blank\">John Wick Original Soundtrack</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you want By Night Studios to release new LARP RULES for NWoD,<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/313137-open-letter-to-by-night-studios\" target=\"_blank\">like this post</a>.<br /> <br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=62\" data-tempid=\"temp_62_1418088885567_853\" />","edited":{"userid":594,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/594-chattnos","user":"Chattnos","date":". 12-26-2014, 07:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/594-chattnos","name":"Chattnos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"879"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T02:09:48-08:00","id":397289,"title":"","content":"I'm throwing together another compilation, but here are a few thus far (as I edit and curate the list I'll have to rearrange it):<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://youtu.be/K_eQqeN6-TE\" target=\"_blank\">Sheryl Crow - On the Outside</a> (Ignore the FMV. A longer, live version <a href=\"http://youtu.be/lDUjrF3qv9U\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> with the rest of the lyrics.)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zBMCQOGwdGw\" target=\"_blank\">Pitch Black - Urbanoia</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uarX1MQhfOE\" target=\"_blank\">Rolling Stones (Avengers) - Paint it Black</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bpOSxM0rNPM\" target=\"_blank\">Arctic Monkeys - Do I Wanna Know?</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w4rZ-iYAq44\" target=\"_blank\">Eisbrecher - Kinder der Nacht</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=50fBVpjz8qI\" target=\"_blank\">Aquilo - Human</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000080\">&quot;There is the world of light, and the world of darkness. And some in the light prefer the darkness.&quot; \u2014 Loren Eiseley, <i>The Night Country</i></span>","edited":{"userid":583,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/583-zsander","user":"Zsander","date":". 02-08-2015, 05:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/583-zsander","name":"Zsander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar583_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-09T16:32:15-08:00","id":399505,"title":"","content":"For anyone looking for instrumentals <i>sans </i>lyrics, there's a couple o' guys who go by <i>Two Steps From Hell </i>who do movie trailer and movie trailer-type music. Their early stuff, which I haven't listened to yet, is bundled into albums with names like<i> Ashes, Power of Darkness, and Pathogen</i>, so that might be suitable.<br /> <br /> Their newest stuff, which I <i>have</i> listened to, is more... think White and Blue/White from M:tG.<br /> <br /> Edit: Also, seconding Birthday Massacre. I have a friend who reviews music who thinks they're a little too Hot Topic for &quot;real&quot; goth taste, but in this context that'll probably count in their favor <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1289,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1289-hastur00","user":"Hastur00","date":". 02-09-2015, 07:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1289-hastur00","name":"Hastur00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1289_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T18:19:15-07:00","id":434969,"title":"","content":"Went home for a few days this past week and it made me nostalgic for the 90s. So, with that in mind, here's a Requiem for the 90s playlist.<br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Requiem for the 90s</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Marilyn Manson - Great Big White World</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">White Zombie - Blood, Milk, and Sky</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Rollins Band - Liar</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Portishead - Wandering Star</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Mors Syphilitica - As We Slept</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Nick Cave and the Bad Seeds - Do You Love Me?</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">The Toadies - Tyler</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Gravity Kills - Inside</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Deftones - Be Quiet and Drive</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Sister Machine Gun - Sins of the Flesh</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Rage Against the Machine - Bombtrack</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Korn - Make Me Bad</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">The Newlydeads - Cities in Dust</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Smashing Pumpkins - Thirty-Three</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Failure - Heliotropic</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">The Flys - Got You Where I Want You</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLyUSJsBW7mES0FiwsHKScUs2c8FQMpbdv\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLyUSJsBW7mES0FiwsHKScUs2c8FQMpbdv\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLyUSJsBW7mES0FiwsHKScUs2c8FQMpbdv\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLyUSJsBW7mES0FiwsHKScUs2c8FQMpbdv </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1257-kerensky","name":"Kerensky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1257_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T09:37:34-07:00","id":437118,"title":"","content":"For anything WOD or NWOD, there exist a song or songs by Tom Waits that are ideal.<br /> <br /> I reccomend anyone not familiar with the man's work to start with Small Change and then bounce about to see what if anything is right for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4630-jmecha","name":"JMecha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4630_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T14:40:25-07:00","id":437550,"title":"","content":"I think a lot of the 'lyric music' is meant to be inspirational for the theme of the game, not explicitly for use in the game. <br /> <br /> When I run WoD tabletop, I have used a collection of video game OSTs, primarily Silent Hill and Castlevania as music IN game (along with a smattering of others, if players are, say, in an industrial club or something).<br /> <br /> So I'll split mine into two: Inspirational and Background.<br /> <br /> <i>Inspirational</i><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w1G-9WUgptY\" target=\"_blank\">Blutengel - Reich mir de Hand</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rJ6O5sTPn1k\" target=\"_blank\">Blutengel - Kreiger</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i0WwF_bVhZU\" target=\"_blank\">Blutengel - Save our Souls</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=52xoRLh2dWw\" target=\"_blank\">Psyclon Nine - Parasitic</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mhFxw09IX7I\" target=\"_blank\">Blutengel - Nachtbringer</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n0Cdsj1AqXk\" target=\"_blank\">Communion After Dar Sept. 2013 (huge industrial mix)</a><br /> <br /> <i>Background</i><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G58ymf6uqBg\" target=\"_blank\">Harmony of Despair - Lost Portrait</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maqx6biRfZ8\" target=\"_blank\">Halloween Carols - Sleeping Dust</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xKFWF3zwifg\" target=\"_blank\">Halloween Carols - Blood Waltz</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qh8cV6qTwmE\" target=\"_blank\">Transylvanian Lullaby (Remix by Kate Covington)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qnf8vATuWVY\" target=\"_blank\">Peter Gundry - Vampire Cello</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T08:52:49-07:00","id":438469,"title":"","content":"That Communion After Dark channel is awesome! Thank you so much for posting it. I've subscribed and have been enjoying it.<br /> <br /> Slight addition to my Requiem for the 90s playlist:<br /> <br /> Danzig - How the Gods Kill<br /> <br /> Also working on a bonus Gangsta Rap playlist, because I think that it was a very influential thing in the 90s.<br /> Also also working on a New Wave Requiem playlist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1257-kerensky","name":"Kerensky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1257_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T22:22:40-07:00","id":440896,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kerensky</strong> <a 